{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51141","headline":"落成会咏二首（前一首《全唐诗》已收） · 陈元光","name":"落成会咏二首（前一首《全唐诗》已收）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云霄开岳镇，日月列衙瞻。\n胜日当佳庆，清风去积炎。\n山畚遥猎虎，海舶近通盐。\n龙泽覃江浦，螭坳耀斗蟾。\n文床堆玉笏，武座肃金签。\n奇计绳陈美，明诚学孔兼。\n忠勤非一日，箴训要三拈。\n千古清泉水，居官显孝廉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51141.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51141","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}